cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software when using the observed-trend workflow."
type: software
title: "Observed Climate Extremes and Electricity Grid Exposure in Brazil"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bazzanela"
    given-names: "Anna Carolina"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Research code for calculating and mapping observed ETCCDI index trends
  in Brazil using Sen slopes and the original Mann-Kendall test, with
  optional electricity infrastructure overlays. This repository covers
  the observed-trend component, not the full CMIP6 projection workflow.
keywords:
  - climate extremes
  - ETCCDI
  - Brazil
  - electricity grids
  - Mann-Kendall
  - Sen slope
